  "basicText": {
    "title": "基本课文",
    "basicSentences": [
      {
        "id": "l45-basic-s001",
        "order": 1,
        "text": "少子化が進んで、日本の人口はだんだん減っていくでしょう。",
        "translationZh": "随着少子化的发展，日本的人口大概会逐渐减少吧。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "1. 少子化が進んで、日本の人口はだんだん減っていくでしょう。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l45-basic-s001",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-s001.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 4.9,
          "duration": 4.9,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-basic-s002",
        "order": 2,
        "text": "ずっと本を読んでいたので、目が疲れてきました。",
        "translationZh": "因为一直在看书，眼睛都疲劳了。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "2. ずっと本を読んでいたので、目が疲れてきました。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l45-basic-s002",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-s002.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3.82,
          "duration": 3.82,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-basic-s003",
        "order": 3,
        "text": "おいしいし、手軽だし、わたしは冷凍食品をよく食べます。",
        "translationZh": "因为好吃，而且方便，我经常吃冷冻食品。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "3. おいしいし、手軽だし、わたしは冷凍食品をよく食べます。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l45-basic-s003",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-s003.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 4.98,
          "duration": 4.98,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-basic-s004",
        "order": 4,
        "text": "この本は読めば読むほどおもしろいです。",
        "translationZh": "这本书越读越有意思。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "4. この本は読めば読むほどおもしろいです。",
        "audioSegment": {
          "id": "l45-basic-s004",
          "trackId": "lesson_basic",
          "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-s004.mp3",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 3.38,
          "duration": 3.38,
          "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
          "confidence": "approved",
          "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
          "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
        }
      }
    ],
    "dialogues": [
      {
        "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-001",
        "label": "A",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-001-line-001",
            "speaker": "甲",
            "text": "最近、中国へ旅行に行く日本人が増えてきましたね。",
            "translationZh": "最近，去中国旅行的日本人增加了呢。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "甲：最近、中国へ旅行に行く日本人が増えてきましたね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-001-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-dialogue-001-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.54,
              "duration": 4.54,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-001-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "ええ、ホテルや交通の便がよくなりましたからね。",
            "translationZh": "是啊，因为酒店和交通都方便了嘛。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：ええ、ホテルや交通の便がよくなりましたからね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-001-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-dialogue-001-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.34,
              "duration": 4.34,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-002",
        "label": "B",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-002-line-001",
            "speaker": "甲",
            "text": "お母さん、雨が降ってきたよ。",
            "translationZh": "妈妈，下雨了。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "甲：お母さん、雨が降ってきたよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-002-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-dialogue-002-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.26,
              "duration": 2.26,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-002-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "あら、大変。誠、洗濯物入れてよ。",
            "translationZh": "哎呀，不好了。诚，快把洗好的衣服收进来。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：あら、大変。誠、洗濯物入れてよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-002-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-dialogue-002-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.34,
              "duration": 4.34,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-003",
        "label": "C",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "甲",
            "text": "休みだし、天気もいいし、どこかに出かけませんか。",
            "translationZh": "正好放假，天气也好，要不要去什么地方走走？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "甲：休みだし、天気もいいし、どこかに出かけませんか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-dialogue-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.66,
              "duration": 4.66,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "いいですね。わたしはハイキングに行きたいです。",
            "translationZh": "好啊。我想去徒步旅行。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：いいですね。わたしはハイキングに行きたいです。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-dialogue-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.58,
              "duration": 3.58,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-004",
        "label": "D",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-004-line-001",
            "speaker": "甲",
            "text": "商品は安ければ安いほど売れるんでしょう？",
            "translationZh": "商品越便宜就越好卖吧？",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "甲：商品は安ければ安いほど売れるんでしょう？",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-004-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-dialogue-004-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.14,
              "duration": 3.14,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-004-line-002",
            "speaker": "乙",
            "text": "いいえ。品質が悪いと、安くても売れません。",
            "translationZh": "不是。质量不好的话，便宜也卖不出去。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "乙：いいえ。品質が悪いと、安くても売れません。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-basic-dialogue-004-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_basic",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-basic-dialogue-004-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 3.02,
              "duration": 3.02,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:31:11.174Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "4504bae8523b3b72ee4ace319ce8589a0a1512ae1d73c5210eb5dfe899ef026c"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
