  "applicationText": {
    "title": "上海",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "l45-app-block-001",
        "type": "narration",
        "text": "JC策划公司计划在上海成立事务所。被内定为事务所所长的老陈带着森到上海寻找事务所的所在地。森第一次到上海。他们的日程是三天两夜。",
        "translationZh": "JC策划公司计划在上海成立事务所。被内定为事务所所长的老陈带着森到上海寻找事务所的所在地。森第一次到上海。他们的日程是三天两夜。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "JC策划公司计划在上海成立事务所。被内定为事务所所长的老陈带着森到上海寻找事务所的所在地。森第一次到上海。他们的日程是三天两夜。"
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-app-block-002",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "（夜晚，他们在机场通往市内的高速公路上）",
        "translationZh": "（夜晚，他们在机场通往市内的高速公路上）",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（夜晚，他们在机场通往市内的高速公路上）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-app-block-003",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-001",
            "speaker": "陈",
            "text": "森さん、見えてきましたよ。（指着前方）あそこが上海の中心地です。",
            "translationZh": "森先生，已经看到了。（指着前方）那边就是上海的中心地带。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "陈：森さん、見えてきましたよ。（指着前方）あそこが上海の中心地です。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-app-block-003-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.9,
              "duration": 4.9,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:32:12.562Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "223cf6eb2b5d21c4079585dca1a1296744a1814f54779656def21e04b100b310"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-002",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "ライトアップされていますね。うーん、見れば見るほどきれいだなあ。",
            "translationZh": "灯光照明着呢。嗯，越看越漂亮啊。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：ライトアップされていますね。うーん、見れば見るほどきれいだなあ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-app-block-003-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.34,
              "duration": 5.34,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:32:12.562Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "223cf6eb2b5d21c4079585dca1a1296744a1814f54779656def21e04b100b310"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-003",
            "speaker": "陈",
            "text": "以前住んでいたことがあるんですが、とても住みやすい所ですよ。",
            "translationZh": "我以前住过这里，是个非常宜居的地方。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "陈：以前住んでいたことがあるんですが、とても住みやすい所ですよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-app-block-003-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.58,
              "duration": 4.58,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:32:12.562Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "223cf6eb2b5d21c4079585dca1a1296744a1814f54779656def21e04b100b310"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-004",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "陳さん、上海に住んでいたんですか。",
            "translationZh": "陈先生，您以前住在上海吗。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：陳さん、上海に住んでいたんですか。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-004",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-app-block-003-line-004.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 2.34,
              "duration": 2.34,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:32:12.562Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "223cf6eb2b5d21c4079585dca1a1296744a1814f54779656def21e04b100b310"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-005",
            "speaker": "陈",
            "text": "ええ。本当にいい所です。住めば住むほど、上海のよさが分かりますよ。",
            "translationZh": "是啊。真的是个好地方。住得越久，就越能了解上海的好。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "陈：ええ。本当にいい所です。住めば住むほど、上海のよさが分かりますよ。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-app-block-003-line-005",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-app-block-003-line-005.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.01,
              "duration": 5.01,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:32:12.562Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "223cf6eb2b5d21c4079585dca1a1296744a1814f54779656def21e04b100b310"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-app-block-004",
        "type": "scene",
        "text": "（在宾馆办完入住手续后，来到街上）",
        "translationZh": "（在宾馆办完入住手续后，来到街上）",
        "confidence": "high",
        "rawText": "（在宾馆办完入住手续后，来到街上）"
      },
      {
        "id": "l45-app-block-005",
        "type": "dialogue",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l45-app-block-005-line-001",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "にぎやかだし、高いビルが多いし、なんか東京に似ていますね。",
            "translationZh": "很热闹，高楼也很多，总觉得有点像东京呢。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：にぎやかだし、高いビルが多いし、なんか東京に似ていますね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-app-block-005-line-001",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-app-block-005-line-001.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.3,
              "duration": 5.3,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:32:12.562Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "223cf6eb2b5d21c4079585dca1a1296744a1814f54779656def21e04b100b310"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-app-block-005-line-002",
            "speaker": "陈",
            "text": "上海は急速に近代化が進んで、町並みが大きく変わってきましたからね。",
            "translationZh": "上海正在迅速现代化，街景也发生了很大变化嘛。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "陈：上海は急速に近代化が進んで、町並みが大きく変わってきましたからね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-app-block-005-line-002",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-app-block-005-line-002.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 5.78,
              "duration": 5.78,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:32:12.562Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "223cf6eb2b5d21c4079585dca1a1296744a1814f54779656def21e04b100b310"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "l45-app-block-005-line-003",
            "speaker": "森",
            "text": "そう言えば、何年か前にリニアモーターカーが開通したんですよね。",
            "translationZh": "这么说起来，好像几年前磁悬浮列车就开通了吧。",
            "confidence": "high",
            "rawText": "森：そう言えば、何年か前にリニアモーターカーが開通したんですよね。",
            "audioSegment": {
              "id": "l45-app-block-005-line-003",
              "trackId": "lesson_apps",
              "sourceUrl": "/data/ocr/audio-clips/lesson45/l45-app-block-005-line-003.mp3",
              "start": 0,
              "end": 4.74,
              "duration": 4.74,
              "method": "approved-asr-alignment",
              "confidence": "approved",
              "reviewedAt": "2026-08-05T10:32:12.562Z",
              "sourceAudioSha256": "223cf6eb2b5d21c4079585dca1a1296744a1814f54779656def21e04b100b310"
            }
          },
          {
